concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-emergencies-and-disasters-act-2006-sch-1-sec-80l a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80L Form of declarations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-80l ;
    values:originalText "(1) An emergency declaration must be in writing and signed by:  (a) if the Prime Minister makes the declaration—the Prime Minister; or  (b) if the Minister makes the declaration—the Minister.  (2) An emergency declaration must be published, as soon as practicable after the declaration has effect:  (a) on the website maintained by the Department on the Internet; and  (b) by notice published in the Gazette.  (3) An emergency declaration is not a legislative instrument. 80M  When declarations take effect  An emergency declaration has effect from the time at which the declaration is signed. 80N  When declarations cease to have effect  An emergency declaration ceases to have effect at the earliest of:  (a) if a time at which the declaration will cease to have effect is specified in the declaration—at that time; or  (b) the time at which the declaration is revoked; or  (c) the end of 12 months starting when the declaration is made." ;
    skos:definition "(1) An emergency declaration must be in writing and signed by:  (a) if the Prime Minister makes the declaration—the Prime Minister; or  (b) if the Minister makes the declaration—the Minister.  (2) An emergency declaration must be published, as soon as practicable after the declaration has effect:  (a) on the website maintained by the Department on the Internet; and  (b) by notice published in the Gazette.  (3) An emergency declaration is not a legislative instrument. 80M  When declarations take effect  An emergency declaration has effect from the time at which the declaration is signed. 80N  When declarations cease to have effect  An emergency declaration ceases to have effect at the earliest of:  (a) if a time at which the declaration will cease to have effect is specified in the declaration—at that time; or  (b) the time at which the declaration is revoked; or  (c) the end of 12 months starting when the declaration is made."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bdf4a828e9c304309781b33b947c93ff22de5f2e5bdf53562d5e62ce9c92c58a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-emergencies-and-disasters-act-2006-sch-1-sec-80l-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-emergencies-and-disasters-act-2006-sch-1-sec-80l-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-emergencies-and-disasters-act-2006-sch-1-sec-80l-ss-3 ;
