concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-emergencies-and-disasters-act-2006-sch-1-sec-80r a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80R Operation of Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-80r ;
    values:originalText "(1) The operation of this Part is not limited by a secrecy provision of any other law of the Commonwealth (whether made before or after the commencement of this Act) except to the extent that the secrecy provision expressly excludes the operation of this section. Note: Section 3 provides for the concurrent operation of State and Territory laws.  (2) Nothing in this Part is to be taken to require an entity to collect, use or disclose personal information.  Schedule 1  Privacy Act 1988" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The operation of this Part is not limited by a secrecy provision of any other law of the Commonwealth (whether made before or after the commencement of this Act) except to the extent that the secrecy provision expressly excludes the operation of this section. Note: Section 3 provides for the concurrent operation of State and Territory laws.  (2) Nothing in this Part is to be taken to require an entity to collect, use or disclose personal information.  Schedule 1  Privacy Act 1988"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cef6ed773147663d519503db12418a24a71d06246b6d683281086efedc7fa2ca" ;
    cof:pageNumber "13"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-emergencies-and-disasters-act-2006-sch-1-sec-80r-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-emergencies-and-disasters-act-2006-sch-1-sec-80r-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-legislation-amendment-emergencies-and-disasters-act-2006.pdf> ;
    dc:source "privacy-legislation-amendment-emergencies-and-disasters-act-2006.pdf, p.13" .
